---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTABand from '../components/CTABand.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Buy UK Property from India | UK Buying Agent | Salet"
  description="Buying UK property from India. Salet is your representative on the ground: viewings, verification, negotiation, completion and ongoing care, with one accountable point of contact."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="For India-based buyers"
    title="Buying in the UK from India comes down to one question: who do you trust on the ground?"
    lede="Salet is your eyes, your hands and your representative in the UK."
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="prose-salet lg:col-span-7">
        <h2>Remote buying fails at the verification step</h2>
        <p>
          Photographs are marketing. From abroad you cannot stand in the property, and the UK process assumes you can.
        </p>
        <h2>What Salet does for remote buyers</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Represents only you.</strong> No listings, nothing from sellers.</li>
          <li><strong>Views and verifies in person.</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Analyses like an institution.</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Negotiates and progresses</strong> through to completion.</li>
          <li><strong>Signposts the cross-border practicalities.</strong> We do not give financial or tax advice.</li>
          <li><strong>Stays after completion.</strong></li>
        </ul>
        <h2>One point of contact, in your evening hours</h2>
        <p>
          You deal with the founder directly, on <a href="https://wa.me/447878781100" rel="noopener" target="_blank">WhatsApp (+44 7878 781100)</a>
          and on calls around the time difference.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="reveal border border-line bg-ivory-2/60 p-8 lg:p-10">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-green-2">A good fit if</p>
          <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone">
            <li>You are buying at £250,000 or above</li>
            <li>Funds are in place</li>
            <li>You want one accountable representative</li>
            <li>You expect honest reports</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-6 text-xs leading-relaxed text-mist">
            Salet does not market properties or investment schemes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABand
    title="Start with a call in your time zone"
    body="30 minutes, in Indian evening hours if that suits."
  />
</Base>
